{
  "uid": "plateforme-sre",
  "title": "Plateforme SRE locale",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "tags": [
    "plateforme",
    "sre"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Disponibilité des services",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Spans reçus par Tempo / seconde",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(tempo_distributor_spans_received_total[5m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Mémoire résidente des services",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "process_resident_memory_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Interpréter les traces et les coûts",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Dans Explore / Tempo, filtrer `{ resource.service.name = \"sre-agent\" }`. Les coûts unitaires sont `ambicrafted.cost_usd` sur les spans LLM. Le total du run est `ambicrafted.run.cost_usd` sur la racine. Ne pas additionner les coûts de plusieurs services. Une pause humaine normale ne porte pas le statut ERROR. Les alertes Prometheus sont visibles localement ; aucun envoi de notification externe n’est configuré."
      }
    }
  ]
}
